000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. KSDSRND2.
000300*ACCESS RANDOM on the cluster KSDSBOTH left: REWRITE and DELETE
000400*name the record by its key, with no READ first (VI-13, VI-27).
000500*They once acted on whatever the retrieval string held, and
000600*VSAM's feedback 92 came out as status 30 (#37). By the
000700*standard's text: IBM ANS COBOL has no VSAM.
000800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000900 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001000 FILE-CONTROL.
001100     SELECT K-FILE ASSIGN TO KSDSF01
001200         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
001300         ACCESS IS RANDOM
001400         RECORD KEY IS K-KEY
001500         FILE STATUS IS K-STATUS.
001600 DATA DIVISION.
001700 FILE SECTION.
001800 FD  K-FILE LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
001900     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
002000 01  K-REC.
002100     05  K-KEY   PIC X(10).
002200     05  K-TEXT  PIC X(5).
002300     05  FILLER  PIC X(65).
002400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002500 01  K-STATUS PIC XX VALUE '00'.
002600 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002700 MAIN-PARA.
002800     OPEN I-O K-FILE.
002900     DISPLAY 'OPEN I-O ' K-STATUS.
003000     MOVE SPACES TO K-REC.
003100     MOVE '0000000004' TO K-KEY.  MOVE 'QUATR' TO K-TEXT.
003200     REWRITE K-REC
003300         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'REWRITE 4 INVALID ' K-STATUS.
003400     DISPLAY 'REWRITE 4 ' K-STATUS.
003500     MOVE '0000000001' TO K-KEY.
003600     DELETE K-FILE
003700         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'DELETE 1 INVALID ' K-STATUS.
003800     DISPLAY 'DELETE 1 ' K-STATUS.
003900     MOVE '0000000003' TO K-KEY.  MOVE 'TROIS' TO K-TEXT.
004000     REWRITE K-REC
004100         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'REWRITE 3 INVALID ' K-STATUS.
004200     MOVE '0000000002' TO K-KEY.
004300     READ K-FILE
004400         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'READ 2 INVALID ' K-STATUS.
004500     DISPLAY 'READ ' K-KEY ' ' K-TEXT.
004600     MOVE '0000000004' TO K-KEY.
004700     READ K-FILE
004800         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'READ 4 INVALID ' K-STATUS.
004900     DISPLAY 'READ ' K-KEY ' ' K-TEXT.
005000     MOVE '0000000001' TO K-KEY.
005100     READ K-FILE
005200         INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'READ 1 INVALID ' K-STATUS.
005300     CLOSE K-FILE.
005400     STOP RUN.
